svg.metadata:
sibling-of: works/everline-components-master.svg (2026-07-19), works/everline-components-batch2.svg (2026-07-20) — independent batch, not a supersession of either;
spec-reference: docs/design-system-v0.1-batch3-draft.md (not yet created — write after this candidate is reviewed);
status: candidate SVG awaiting human review; created: 2026-07-27; do-not-treat-as-frozen;
scope: batch 3 (8 components) is drawn incrementally, one GitHub issue at a time; this file currently holds only component 1/8 — Progress / Spinner / Loading (issue #5). Components 2-8 (issues #6-#12) will be appended to this same file as each is worked, mirroring how everline-components-master.svg and everline-components-batch2.svg accumulated their components;
backfill-note: issue #5 also requires this component to backfill the `loading` state left deliberately unimplemented for List, Data table and Kanban column (see docs/design-system-v0.1-batch2-draft.md 跨元件設計決策, GitHub issue #13). That backfill is intentionally NOT done in this file — per issue #13's own framing, it happens later in works/html/batch2/ only after this candidate is reviewed, approved, and graduated, so this sheet only needs to decide the loading visual language itself;
token-gap: tokens/everline-draft.tokens.json has no component.progress.* or component.spinner.* entries yet. This candidate reuses existing color.semantic.action-primary (#598AE8) / action-danger (#C1272D) and color.base.gray-700 (#4D4D4D) directly, plus the existing motion.duration-slow (320ms) candidate as the rotation-cycle reference. New component tokens are proposed only after this candidate is approved, per AGENTS.md's token-before-use rule — see 校準清單 note at the bottom of this sheet for the exact candidate values to formalize.
